sperable serían 1,6 contratos. La razón entre observados y esperados es 14,4, con un intervalo de confianza del 95 % de 6,2 a 37,2. El contrato [1], de 39.599 euros, se adjudicó en diciembre de 2025.\nQué no pueden demostrar: la acumulación de importes junto al límite es un indicador estadístico. No prueba que se haya partido ningún contrato ni que alguien haya actuado mal; puede deberse a precios de mercado, a presupuestos cerrados o a necesidades distintas.\nQué se puede revisar: en los expedientes enlazados, qué se contrató en cada caso y en qué fechas, y si varios contratos atienden una misma necesidad que pudo contratarse de una vez.","en":"What the data shows: Between 2023 and 2025, this body awarded 23 minor contracts for works above 37,500 and up to 40,000 euros, just under the legal limit. If those amounts were spread as in the band immediately below, 1.6 contracts would be expected. The observed-to-expected ratio is 14.4, with a 95% confidence interval of 6.2 to 37.2. Contract [1], for 39,599 euros, was awarded in December 2025.\nWhat it cannot show: a pile-up of amounts just under the limit is a statistical indicator. It does not prove that any contract was broken up or that anyone acted improperly; it may reflect market prices, fixed budgets or separate needs.\nWhat can be checked: in the linked contract files, what was bought in each case and on which dates, and whether several contracts meet a single need that could have been procured at once.","origen_es":"plantilla","origen_en":"plantilla","modelo":"Qwen3-4B (Q4_K_M, llama.cpp)","regla":"obras","citas":["qFDShkaI7aTE6P%2FuLemXRw%3D%3D","nP%2FUcMRcGm%2BFlFRHfEzEaw%3D%3D","SrUOqZH1HzekU02jNGj1Fw%3D%3D"],"generado":"2026-11-15"}}